Profile: MII_PR_PRO_Questionnaire_Item_Bank
Parent: MII_PR_PRO_Questionnaire
Id: mii-pr-pro-questionnaire-item-bank
Title: "MII PR PRO Questionnaire Item Bank"
Description: "MII PR PRO Item Bank for Computer Adaptive Testing. Contains the complete set of items from which a CAT engine selects adaptively. Extends the base MII Questionnaire profile with the SDC questionnaireAdaptive extension. Note: This is the definition-level item bank, NOT the runtime contained questionnaire in an adaptive QuestionnaireResponse (which uses sdc-questionnaire-adapt with url 0..0)."

* extension contains http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/sdc/StructureDefinition/sdc-questionnaire-questionnaireAdaptive named questionnaireAdaptive 1..1 MS
